                "A ==.map file== links minified output back to original source",
                "Stack traces and breakpoints show your **real files and lines**",
                "Enabled by a comment at the end of the bundle",
                "Build tools emit it: `sourcemap: true` or webpack `devtool`"
              ],
              "style": "dot"
            },
            {
              "type": "code",
              "lang": "javascript",
              "lines": [
                "//# sourceMappingURL=app.js.map",
                "// build: { sourcemap: true }",
                "// webpack: devtool: 'source-map'"
              ]
            },
            {
